{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve array positions in structured previews.** Every container-array element is collected under the same path, while insertion builds maps, so `items: [{id: \"a\"}, {id: \"b\"}]` collapses to `items: {id: \"b\"}` and silently overwrites earlier elements. Build list nodes with indices, or explicitly omit unsupported container arrays, and add include/mask coverage for arrays of objects.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7of-og","finding_digest":"718bc3f938c04aea1fc6bc8e44a9669e11b41e1275464f408dcf5ddd1d80a3ba","finding_id":"arf_v1_ogf4h6jyybfouh6gxshejklgty","finding_key":"sdk/offload/filesystem/payloadpreview::collect::array-structure-preservation","identity_key":"sdk/offload/filesystem/payloadpreview::collect::array-structure-preservation","line":80,"observation_digest":"3a95c4277645b2eac5d8088a1dc008d0eb081bdcb890bbf988bb72f7719f1bc0","observation_id":"aro_v1_hkk4ij3wiwzovroybcfb3qai2d","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/offload/filesystem/PayloadPreview.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T04:10:13Z","review_id":"arr_v1_777cfhxzfpbb2ru7blzmxzq25s","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"49df563b4c25adde5c13cd1a150cbeb2e556a9ed","reviewer":"codex","start_line":77,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_rw45wzco7wvxtjzsnu2uiytlsm","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T04:10:13Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
